sequenceDiagram
    participant Saga as "TrainingCompletionSaga"
    participant UC as "CompleteTrainingUseCase"
    participant Bus as "EventBus / Kafka"
    participant Outbox as "Outbox Table"
    participant Job as "OutboxProcessorJob"
    participant Courier as "Courier Service"

    Note over Saga: Triggered by TrainingCompletionRequested
    
    Saga->>UC: execute(command)
    UC-->>Saga: result (COMPLETED)
    
    Saga->>Outbox: save(TrainingCompletedEvent)
    Saga->>Outbox: save(EligibilityChangedEvent)
    
    Note over Job: Async Polling
    Job->>Outbox: fetchPending()
    Outbox-->>Job: events
    
    Job->>Bus: publish(TrainingCompleted)
    Job->>Bus: publish(EligibilityChanged)
    
    Note over Courier: Listens to EligibilityChanged
    Bus-->>Courier: consume(EligibilityChanged)
    Courier->>Courier: Update Courier Status
